---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Grossline — pricing"
  description="Flat monthly pricing based on your ad spend — never a percentage of revenue. Three plans: Advisory, Growth, Partner."
  path="/pricing"
  wide
>
  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A flat monthly fee based on your ad-spend band — never a percentage of your revenue. Your fee
    doesn't rise just because you had a good month.
  </p>
  <p><span class="flat">Flat fee · based on ad spend · never % of revenue</span></p>

  <div class="tiers">
    <div class="tier">
      <h3>Advisory</h3>
      <p class="who">The monthly report, delivered.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
        <li>Blended metrics &amp; findings</li>
        <li>Figures reconciled against the platforms</li>
        <li>Delivered by email</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="tier mid">
      <h3>Growth</h3>
      <p class="who">The report, plus the weekly pulse.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything in Advisory</li>
        <li>Weekly digest — five numbers, catches a problem in days</li>
        <li>WhatsApp summary, ready to paste</li>
        <li>Growth opportunities tracked month to month</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="tier">
      <h3>Partner</h3>
      <p class="who">Hands-on, for scaling brands.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything in Growth</li>
        <li>A deeper review cadence</li>
        <li>A direct line to the analyst</li>
        <li>Priority on new findings as they land</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Your band depends on your monthly ad spend. Tell us your spend and we'll quote the flat fee —
    <a href="/contact">request a quote</a>, and your first report is free.
  </p>

  <h2>What clients say</h2>
  <div class="quote-slot">A client quote will go here once we have a real one worth quoting.</div>
</Base>
